Scoped kirsch video filter

The common option table (planes, scale, delta), the pix_fmts list,
param_init's plane geometry and per-plane copy mask for kirsch, the
avpriv_mirror border addressing of setup_3x3, the slice row loop of
filter_slice and the eight-bit eight-direction compass sums of
filter_kirsch, with av_clip_uint8(FFABS(max) * scale + delta), in
src/video-ops/kirsch.ts follow libavfilter/vf_convolution.c and
libavfilter/convolution.h (common_options, pix_fmts, param_init,
setup_3x3, filter_slice, filter_kirsch, filter_frame, ff_vf_kirsch) and
libavutil/internal.h (avpriv_mirror).
